OL,3,GNEWSAViews sought on boys' school
OL,4,Aaccepting girls
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being asked whether they
OL,7,Fsupport admitting girls to the sixth
OL,8,Fform of a boys' school.
OL,10,FVictoria College in Jersey said in July
OL,11,F79% of respondents to a survey about
OL,12,Fthe proposals backed the move which it
OL,13,Fdescribed as "a very strong mandate for
OL,14,Fchange".
OL,16,FDeputy Catherine Curtis, Minister for
OL,17,FEducation and Lifelong Learning, has
OL,18,Fextended the consultation island-wide
OL,19,Fand has sought views on the potential
OL,20,Fimpact of the plans for students,
OL,21,Ffamilies and the wider education
OL,22,Fsystem.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
