OL,3,GNEWSAViews sought on boys' school
OL,4,Aaccepting girls
OL,5,
OL,6,FGareth Hughes, head teacher of the
OL,7,FStates-funded, fee paying school, said
OL,8,Fgirls joining years 12 and 13 would
OL,9,F"strengthen the long-term
OL,10,Fsustainability and vibrancy" of the
OL,11,Fsixth form.
